**2. SeekBar `markers` and `partialDisablingConfiguration` — confirmed:**

Both props are documented. Quoting from the search results (sources: `https://developer.amazon.com/docs/vega-api/0.21/seekbar.html`, `0.22`, `0.23`, `0.24`):

- **`markers`**: *"Markers — Custom React nodes or views laid out horizontally throughout the SeekBar. Three types: ReactNode markers (custom components), Point markers (colored points), and Segment markers (break markers)."*

- **`partialDisablingConfiguration`**: *"When provided, this prop overrides the global `disabled` and `disabledWhenNotFocused` settings... Available actions: playPause, skipBackward, skipForward, left, right, select, back. When you provide the PartialDisablingConfiguration object, all default values for the actions are set to false."*
